## Implementation Plan: Enhanced Widget Success Result (Delivery Date, Countdown Timer, Delivery Fee)

### Overview

This plan adds three high-impact features to the Pinzo widget's success state: calculated delivery dates, live countdown timers to cutoff, and delivery fee/free shipping display. Changes span 6 files across 4 layers: database schema, API, admin UI, and storefront widget.

