showDeliveryFee     Boolean @default(true)
```

Then run:
```bash
npx prisma migrate dev --name add_widget_delivery_date_countdown_fee_toggles
```

This is the only migration needed. The `deliveryFee`, `freeShippingAbove`, and `estimatedDays` fields already exist on `DeliveryRule`.

**Default values:** All `true` so existing merchants immediately benefit. The storefront widget gracefully degrades -- if the API returns `null` for `estimatedDeliveryDate` or `deliveryFee`, the widget simply hides those rows.

